  sentBack: "\u1EDE ngo\xE0i v\xF9ng s\xE1ng qu\xE1 l\xE2u - b\u1ECB \u0111\u01B0a
    v\u1EC1 \u0111i\u1EC3m \u0111\u1EA7u h\xE0nh lang."
  wrongCode: "Sai m\xE3 - b\u1EA3ng b\u1ECB kh\xF3a v\xE0 c\xE1c \xF4 b\u1ECB x\xF3a."
  locked: "B\u1EA3ng \u0111ang b\u1ECB kh\xF3a."
